{"resourceIdentifier":"2347","resourceName":"FOÇA BIOGAS ENERGY POWER PLANT","description":"The proposed project activity is a biogas-to-energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from cattle manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through cogeneration systems. The project is being implemented by ENERGROM A.Ş. in the Foça district, İzmir province, in Turkey. \r\n\r\nAgricultural activities have been a main household income source for those living in Foça. While the number of stockbreeders and poultry farms has substantially increased for the last years in the region, cattle manure generated at farms has, however, become a major environmental, economic and legal problem for cattle breeders and poultry farmers, as well as for the local people living around farms. \r\n\r\nThe proposed project activity provides an environmentally friendly solution to this manure management problem. \r\n\r\nApproximately 337 tons of cattle manure and 100 tons of chicken manure generated at farms in the region will be collected daily through special sewage trucks equipped with close-tanks in order to prevent any odor and/or manure leakages and to be fed into the anaerobic digesters at the proposed biogas power plant.\r\n\r\nWithin the scope of the planned project, biodegradation of organic wastes coming to the Biogas Plant in an anaerobic environment will take place. The biogas that will be released during the biodegradation of organic wastes will be used for electricity and heat production in the cogeneration units. The cogeneration system to be installed will be designed with a total power of 3.2 MWe/h, the electricity to directly fed to the national grid. \r\n\r\nThe proposed project activity will generate around 331,795 tCO2eq/y emissions reduction annually, mainly by preventing GHG emissions from being emitted directly to the atmosphere from cattle manure that would be otherwise left to decay in aerobic conditions.\r\n\r\nFor more info:\r\nhttps://m.youtube.com/watch?v=e35lKBX21dY","location":{"latitude":38.664625,"longitude":26.937850},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-10-21","endExclusive":"2020-11-21","endInclusive":"2020-11-20"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2347"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"İzmir"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2347"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"331795"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"TÜV SÜD South Asia Private Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18/11/2021"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 29/10/2019 - 28/10/2026"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49030&IDKEY=998klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d867612370","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Draft Project-Description-Template-v4.0 FocL'a Biogas Energy Power Plant, revUO (ID2347), Listing Request 102120.pdf","uploadDate":"2020-10-21T02:28:46.413Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=49031&IDKEY=8kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj909067613749","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representatio